---
# Imported from Noah Gibbs' Shoes-Spec corpus by spec/import_shoes_spec.rb.
# Change it through RULINGS or FIXES there: a re-import rewrites this file.
source: cases/scarpe_examples/legacy/for_playtest/shoes-contrib/basic/two-column.sspec
source_commit: 1e766c6
display: any
expect: fail
reason: Lacci makes title, subtitle, banner and caption Para subclasses (element.title),
  so paras() still includes them, and the finders go by size, so restyling the size
  loses the banner
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  flow do
    stack :width => 200 do
      caption "Column one"
      para "is 200 pixels wide"
    end
    stack :width => -200 do
      caption "Column two"
      para "is 100% minus 200 pixels wide"
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
# Tests two-column layout with fixed and fluid widths
caps = captions()
assert_equal "Column one", caps[0].text
assert_equal "Column two", caps[1].text
ps = paras()
assert_includes ps[0].text, "200 pixels wide"
assert_includes ps[1].text, "100% minus 200 pixels"
